<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-W.P. 164-2 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-W.P. 164-2 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province were 164 for two after 65 overs at tea on the first day of their Supersport Series match against Natal at Newlands on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Province 164-2, 65 overs (Desmond Haynes 83) against Natal.</p>
